Well, that model has no free parameters to fit, does it?  What exactly do
you want to do?

BTW the MLE of the mean of a Gamma glm does not depend on the shape,
so glm() does fit the MLE for any fixed shape.  What it is does not do is
to estimate the shape, by MLE or otherwise.

